    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "A collection of texts from 1916-1917 in Urdu, Arabic, and Persian from colonial India. They pertain to a major public debate on philosophical matters. Collection of texts in Urdu, Arabic and Persian in one pdf pertaining to a major public debate in colonial India on philosophical matters that took place from 1916-1917. Editor, \"Khāṣṣ Bāgh mein munāz̤arah\" in Dabdaba-yi Sikandarī vol. 37, no. 37, July 24, 1916, no page numbers (p. 1 on pdf); Muḥammad Tāhā, \"Munāẓara-yi Riyāsat-i Rāmpūr,\" no further publication date available (page 1-3 on pdf); Mawlawī ʻAbd al-ʻAzīz, \"Ifāḍat al-Nūr ʻalā Munāẓarat Rāmpūr,\" Akhlāqī Press: Bankipore (Patna), 1334 AH (p. 3-14 on pdf); Muʻīn al-Dīn Ajmīrī, \"Chihār Tāziyānih-i Qahhār,\" Dillī Printing Press: Delhi, 1916 (p. 15-16 on pdf); Muʻīn al-Dīn Ajmīrī, \"al-Hujjah al-Lāhūtiyah li-Istīṣāl shubhat al-Ṣaḥīfah al-Malakūtīyah,\" no further publication date available (p. 16-18 on pdf); Anonymous, \"Munāẓarah-i Rāmpūr kā Ṣaḥīḥ ḳhāk\" no further publication information available (p. 18-19 on pdf); Anonymous, \"Munāẓarat-i Mūr o Sulaymān,\" no publication date available (p. 20 on pdf); Muḥammad Sharīf Khān, \"Haqīqat-i Munāẓarah-yi Rāmpūr,\" Akbar-i Aʻẓam Press: Benares, 1334 AH (p. 24-25 on pdf); Muḥammad Sharīf Khān, \"al-Taqrīr al-Kāmil fī Tanbīh al-Ghāfil,\" Akbar-i Aʻẓam Press: Benares, 1334 AH (p. 26-29 on pdf); Muḥammad Sharīf Khān, \"Kayfiyyat-i Munāẓara-yi Banāras,\" Akbar-i Aʻẓam Press: Benares, 1334 AH (p. 29 on pdf); Muḥammad Sharīf Khān, \"Tanqīd o Tanqīh-i Risālah-yi Niẓāmiyyah-yi Muṣannafah-yi Shams al-ʻUlamāʼ Janāb Mawlawī ʻAbd al-Wahhāb Sāḥib Bihārī,\" Akbar-i Aʻẓam Press: Benares, 1334 AH (p. 29-30 on pdf); Abū al-Fatḥ Muḥammad Husayn, \"Damīmah-i Munāz̤arah-i Riyāsat-i Rāmpūr bi-Jawāb-i Risālah-yi Ifādat al-Nūr,\" Waḥīdī Press: Kolkata, n.d. (p. 31-34 on pdf); Mawlawī ʻAbd al-ʻAzīz Bihārī, \"Māniʻ-i Ghalat Fahmī bi-Jawāb-i Damīma-yi Munāẓara-yi Riyāsat-i Rāmpūr,\" Maṭbaʻ-i Mujībī: Phulwārī Sharīf, n.d. (p. 35-42 on pdf); Muḥammad Sharīf, \"al-Rimāḥ al-Khaṭṭīyah ʻalā al-Saḥīfah al-Malakūtīyah,\" no further publication information available (p. 43-46 on pdf); Mawlawī ʻAbd al-ʻAzīz Bihārī, \"ʻAjāʼib al-Duhūr Yaʻnī Munāẓarah-yi Rāmpūr,\" no further publication information available (p. 47-50 on pdf); Mawlawī Muḥammad Maqbūl Aḥmad, \"Al-Tāmmah al-Kubrā,\" Maṭbaʻ-yi Mujībī: Phulwārī Sharīf, 1334 AH (p. 51-65) Muʻīn al-Dīn Ajmīrī, \"Khulī Chiththī Kā Khulā Jawāb,\" Lālā Dās Dillī Printing Works, Delhi, n.d. (p. 66-73).",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
